<title>USA: Carter-Wallace gets $18/shr offer from Davis.</title>
<headline>Carter-Wallace gets $18/shr offer from Davis.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carter-Wallace Inc said on Wednesday that it has received a letter from Davis Companies stating that Davis is prepared to negotiate the acquisition of all outstanding Carter-Wallace stock at $18 per share.</p>
<p>Los Angeles-based Davis Companies is a closely held company owned by investor Martin Davis.</p>
<p>Carter-Wallace said it has referred the letter to The CPI Development Corp, its majority shareholder.</p>
